# eInvoice Status Tracking

Track whether draft eInvoices on SePay have been signed/issued or deleted. Show real-time status on invoice cards.

## Proposed Changes

### SePay API Used

- **`GET /v1/invoices/{reference_code}`** — Chi tiết hoá đơn
  - Returns `status`: `draft` | `issued` | `cancelled`
  - Returns 404 if deleted on SePay

### Types

#### [MODIFY] [types.ts](file:///e:/TDC_App/TDGAMES_App/td-games-invoice-app/types.ts)
- Expand `einvoice_status`: `'none' | 'draft' | 'issued' | 'failed'` (add `'issued'`)

---

### Service Layer

#### [MODIFY] [sePayService.ts](file:///e:/TDC_App/TDGAMES_App/td-games-invoice-app/services/sePayService.ts)
- Add `getEInvoiceDetail(reference_code)` — calls proxy with action `'get-invoice-detail'`
- Returns: `{ status: 'draft' | 'issued' | 'cancelled', invoice_number, pdf_url }`

#### [MODIFY] [supabaseService.ts](file:///e:/TDC_App/TDGAMES_App/td-games-invoice-app/services/supabaseService.ts)
- [parseInvoice](file:///e:/TDC_App/TDGAMES_App/td-games-invoice-app/services/supabaseService.ts#100-125) already maps the fields, no change needed

---

### Hook & Logic

#### [MODIFY] [useInvoiceState.ts](file:///e:/TDC_App/TDGAMES_App/td-games-invoice-app/hooks/useInvoiceState.ts)
- Add `syncEInvoiceStatuses()` — loops through all invoices with `einvoice_status === 'draft'`, calls `getEInvoiceDetail`:
  - If SePay returns `issued` → update to `einvoice_status: 'issued'` + save `invoice_number`
  - If SePay returns 404 (deleted) → clear eInvoice fields (reset to none)
  - If still `draft` → no change
- Trigger on: (1) manual "Sync" button click, (2) on [loadHistory()](file:///e:/TDC_App/TDGAMES_App/td-games-invoice-app/hooks/useInvoiceState.ts#167-174) load

---

### UI Display

#### [MODIFY] [HistoryTab.tsx](file:///e:/TDC_App/TDGAMES_App/td-games-invoice-app/components/HistoryTab.tsx)
- Badge logic update:
  - `draft` → 🟡 "eInvoice Nháp" (existing, amber)
  - `issued` → 🟢 "eInvoice ✓ Ký" (new, green, with `invoice_number` if available)
  - `failed` → 🔴 "eInvoice ✗" (existing)
- For `issued` invoices: keep download button active (signed PDF)
- Add "🔄" sync button in header to trigger `syncEInvoiceStatuses()`

